    <div class="mt-6 text-xs font-semibold text-purple-300">
      <span>With all best wishes,</span><br/>
      <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm" data-wm="sender_name" data-wm-field="sender_name">\u2014 From Someone Who Cares</span>
    </div>
